# Incident Response

## Severity
| Level | Definition | Response |
|-------|------------|----------|
| SEV1 | Outage | Immediate |
| SEV2 | Major broken | 30 min |
| SEV3 | Degraded | 4 hours |

## Steps

### 1. Assess
- [ ] Determine severity
- [ ] Notify team
- [ ] Start incident doc

### 2. Investigate
- [ ] Check monitoring
- [ ] Check recent deploys
- [ ] Check error logs
- [ ] Check external deps

### 3. Mitigate
- [ ] Rollback (see rollback.md)
- [ ] Toggle feature flag
- [ ] Scale resources
- [ ] Apply hotfix

### 4. Resolve
- [ ] Confirm restored
- [ ] Verify with monitoring
- [ ] Communicate resolution

### 5. Post-Incident
- [ ] Post-mortem (48h for SEV1/2)
- [ ] Document timeline
- [ ] Action items
